                "script": "\ttry:\n\t\tself.refreshBinding(\u0027custom.postIsDisabled\u0027)\n\t\tif(self.custom.postIsDisabled is False):\n\t\t\ttry:\n\t\t\t\tif(self.view.params.isChild):\n\t\t\t\t\t#system.perspective.print(self.view.params.target)\n\t\t\t\t\tsystem.perspective.navigate(page \u003d self.view.params.target, newTab \u003d False)\n\t\t\t\t\tsystem.perspective.closePopup(\u0027operatorHeader\u0027)\n\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\t#system.perspective.print(\u0027item clicked\u0027)\n\t\t\t\t\ttransformOnDropdown \u003d self.getChild(\"FlexContainer_0\").getChild(\"Icon_0\").props.style.transform\n\t\t\t\t\tself.getChild(\"FlexContainer_0\").getChild(\"Icon_0\").props.style.transform \u003d \u0027rotate(90deg)\u0027 if self.getChild(\"FlexContainer_0\").getChild(\"Icon_0\").props.style.transform \u003d\u003d \u0027\u0027 else \u0027\u0027\n\t\t\t\t\tself.view.params.clicked \u003d True if self.view.params.clicked \u003d\u003d False else False\n\t\t\t\t\t#system.perspective.print(self.view.params.clicked)\n\t\t\t\t\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027navItemClicked\u0027, payload \u003d {\u0027parentSection\u0027: self.view.params.optionText})\n\t\t\texcept Exception as e:\n\t\t\t\tsystem.perspective.print(e)\n\texcept Exception as e:\n\t\tsystem.perspective.print(e)"
              },
